{"id":27989,"mal_id":27989,"title":"Hibike! Euphonium","englishTitle":"Sound! Euphonium","title_english":"Sound! Euphonium","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Sound! Euphonium","ja":"響け！ユーフォニアム"},"synopsis":"Now that Kumiko Oumae has enrolled in Kitauji High School, she hopes to forget about her past. Despite her desire for a fresh start, she gets dragged into the school's band club by her new friends—Sapphire Kawashima and Hazuki Katou—and is once again stuck playing the euphonium. \n\nAs the band currently stands, they won't be able to participate in the local festival, Sunfest, let alone compete at a national level. The band's new advisor, Noboru Taki, gives them a choice: they can relax and have fun, or practice hard and attempt to get into nationals. Not wanting to repeat her mistakes from middle school, Kumiko is doubtful as to whether they should try for nationals. Amidst the chaos, she learns that her old bandmate, Reina Kousaka (who she had a bitter relationship with) has joined Kitauji's band club. Under the pressure of Noboru's strict training, Kumiko and her bandmates must learn to overcome their struggles and find success together.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n","synopsis_es":"Ahora que Kumiko Oumae se ha matriculado en la escuela secundaria Kitauji, espera olvidar su pasado. A pesar de su deseo de un nuevo comienzo, sus nuevos amigos (Sapphire Kawashima y Hazuki Katou) la arrastran al club de banda de la escuela y una vez más se queda atrapada tocando el bombardino. \n\nTal como está la banda actualmente, no podrán participar en el festival local, Sunfest, y mucho menos competir a nivel nacional. El nuevo asesor de la banda, Noboru Taki, les da una opción: pueden relajarse y divertirse o practicar mucho e intentar entrar en los nacionales. Al no querer repetir sus errores de la escuela secundaria, Kumiko tiene dudas sobre si deberían intentarlo para los nacionales. En medio del caos, se entera de que su antigua compañera de banda, Reina Kousaka (con quien tenía una relación amarga) se ha unido al club de banda de Kitauji. Bajo la presión del estricto entrenamiento de Noboru, Kumiko y sus compañeros de banda deben aprender a superar sus luchas y encontrar el éxito juntos.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1410,"average_episode_duration":1410,"startDate":"2015-04-08","start_date":"2015-04-08","endDate":"2015-07-01","end_date":"2015-07-01","season":"spring","year":2015,"start_season":{"year":2015,"season":"spring"},"episodes":13,"num_episodes":13,"score":8.03,"mean":8.03,"numListUsers":521183,"num_list_users":521183,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":19,"name":"Music"},{"id":70,"name":"Performing Arts"},{"id":23,"name":"School"}],"studios":[{"id":2,"name":"Kyoto Animation"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/142072.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/142072l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/142072.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/142072l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/142072l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"wednesday","time":"00:30","day_of_the_week":"wednesday","start_time":"00:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"wednesday 00:30"},"rank":717,"popularity":515,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":215888,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2014-10-17T22:27:03+00:00","updated_at":"2025-07-03T08:32:26+00:00","source":"novel","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":31096,"title":"Hibike! Euphonium: Suisougaku-bu no Nichijou","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/5/74706.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/5/7470